# Four-player split-screen (FOURPLAYER.md D4): the 2x2 grid with all four
# seat tints on screen, each ship angled into its own quadrant, a spread of
# rocks so every viewport has something to look at. Layout/QA reference and
# store-shot candidate for the 4P release.
size 1920x1080
seed 41
game 2
clear
players 4
camera fixed
ship 0 0 0
ship2 250 120 90
ship3 -250 -120 -90
ship4 250 -120 180
asteroid -350 250 normal
asteroid 420 300 tough
asteroid -560 -420 reflective
asteroid 380 -280 normal r=60
sim 400
